usage: native_free.py [-h] --weights-dir WEIGHTS_DIR --assets-dir ASSETS_DIR
                      [--device DEVICE] [--threads THREADS]
                      [--native-bin-dir NATIVE_BIN_DIR]
                      [--hemisphere-workers {1,2}]
                      [--native-optimizations {auto,original}]
                      [--profile-stages]
                      [--cuda-allocator-cache {auto,enabled,disabled}]
                      t1 subject_dir

单幅 T1 的 FNIT 皮层重建。必要表面阶段使用固定的完整调用链。

positional arguments:
  t1
  subject_dir

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --weights-dir WEIGHTS_DIR
  --assets-dir ASSETS_DIR
  --device DEVICE
  --threads THREADS
  --native-bin-dir NATIVE_BIN_DIR
  --hemisphere-workers {1,2}
                        independent hemisphere processes; total threads split
                        across two workers
  --native-optimizations {auto,original}
                        validated Conda native hotspot selection; original is
                        the paired control
  --profile-stages      record CUDA synchronization and parent/child CPU time
  --cuda-allocator-cache {auto,enabled,disabled}
